-- title:
--   Exact endpoint witnesses for E8 production cell 0001
-- statement:
--   At dyadic precision160, exact integer intervals and exponential/logarithm witnesses encode sixteen endpoint enclosures for the eight padded inverse brackets of E8 production cell 0001. The shared logarithm-of-two data is included. These are source numerical definitions; successful finite checks and their real-valued enclosure consequences are proved separately.
